 service_at(x,'download','download','Upload installs W1 with the rendered caption package, not the backer download. Preview checks the actual anonymous package.|上传将W1及已渲染字幕真装入公开下载，不是支持者包；预览检查实际匿名包。',{'upload':option('Upload accessible recorded W1|上传已录无障碍W1',requires={'fields':{'caption-state':{'generated':True}}},copy=[{'from':'caption-state','to':'download-state','attributes':['fields']}],post_set={'download-state':{'uploaded':True,'checked':False}}),'preview':option('Inspect actual anonymous W1 package|检查实际匿名W1包',set={'download-state':{'checked':True}},inspect=['download-state'])})
 g1=G(x,'Public build and real input|公开版本与实际输入','K1 and K2 must actually run tested chapter-one public1 or patched1 with working input before18:00. K2 may use patched controller or accepted spare-keyboard public1; do not expose backer2 just because installed.|18点前两机真跑测通第一章public1/patched1及可用输入。K2可修补手柄或备键盘public1，不因已装就公开backer2。',['kiosk-state','release','kiosk-image','input-map'],'18:00',alternative='K2 public1/keyboard with the available spare is fully valid, no extra approval or repaired download is necessary.|K2现有备键盘public1完全可，不另审批或强制修补版。')
 g2=G(x,'No private keys on public surfaces|公开处不放私钥','Remove both fictional private supporter keys from actual overlay and committed stream copy. Deliver each only to its own private supporter via key desk.|实际叠字与已交直播副本去两份虚构私钥，经台只私下各交自己支持者。',['key-ledger','key-state','overlay','stream-overlay'],'19:00')
 G(x,'Two accurate session invitations|两场准确邀请','Main/session-a/session-b must offer confirmed18:00 chapter-one sessions with the actual tested input for each kiosk; preserve both sessions.|主帖和两场说明写准18点第一章及各机真输入，保留两场。',['main','session-a','session-b','kiosk-state'],'18:00')
 G(x,'Actual spoiler-safe stream package|实际无剧透直播包','Replace T2 with approved chapter-one T1 and commit correct overlay/trailer to stream, not just local edit. Do not announce chapter two as public.|实际T2换第一章T1并真提交正确叠字预告，别只本地改，不宣第二章公开。',['stream-state','stream-overlay','overlay'],'19:00')
 G(x,'Matching accessible recorded walkthrough|匹配的无障碍已录讲解','Render C1 matching actual W1, upload the real accessible package and check anonymous download. C2 is wrong even though it renders successfully.|渲染配W1的C1，真上传无障碍包并查匿名下载；C2即使渲染成功也错。',['walkthrough','caption-state','download-state'],'19:00')
