 G(x,'Keep credit and inform photographers|保署名并告摄影者','Tell Ada A17→N7/C02→S8 and Bo B44→N7 after clock correction. Keep both photographers’ credit; do not expose private contact data.|告AdaA17到N7/C02到S8，BoB44修时后N7，保两署名不曝私联。',['ada-dm','bo-dm'],'19:00')
