 G(x,'Usable orders for actual people|实际执行者得可用指令','Tell North volunteer foot window, South team West/drop/walk/window, and driver concrete West18:05 target. Messages must agree with actual final dispatch; no generic summary substitutes.|告北步行窗口，南组西门下车步行时段，司机西门18:05目标；消息符合真最终派遣，泛总结不替代。',['north-dm','south-dm','driver-dm','dispatch-state'],'Before respective departures')
 short=[lookup(k) for k in ['observation-a','observation-b','observation-c','clock','rule','access','volunteers','credits','dispatch']]+[operate('source-a','classify',event='N7'),operate('source-b','classify',event='N7'),operate('source-c','classify',event='S8'),operate('count','recompute'),write('north-map','North: one distinct event N7 from two credited cameras. The promised17:00–17:20 foot check stays.|北：两台署名相机同N7一事件，已约17:00–17:20步行检查照常。'),write('south-map','South: S0 plus S8, two distinct events. Two-person bus team surveys18:15–18:45, West drop then8-minute walk.|南：S0加S8两事件，两人车组18:15–18:45调查，西门下车走八分。'),reply('ada-dm','Your A17 is N7 and C02 is the separate South S8. Both keep your photo credit; A17 and Bo’s B44 share one observation event.|你A17归N7，C02另是南S8，都保你摄影署名；A17与BoB44同观察事件。'),reply('bo-dm','After the60-minute camera correction, B44 is North N7 with A17. Your photo credit stays; this is a duplicate event, not an invented sighting.|相机修60分后B44与A17同北N7，你摄影署名保留，是同事件不是造假。'),write('old-north','Correction: A17/B44 are one N7 event after clock correction, not two because filenames differ.|更正：时钟修正后A17/B44同N7，文件名不同不计两次。'),write('old-fraud','Correction: Bo’s photo is genuine and credited. It shares an event with another camera; that is not fabricated observation.|更正：Bo照片真实且保署名，与另一相机同事件不是观察造假。'),operate('dispatch','North'),operate('dispatch','South'),operate('dispatch','book',drop='East'),operate('gate','check'),operate('dispatch','reroute'),reply('driver-dm','The final booked drop is West at18:05. The South team walks8 minutes to reach the18:15 survey; do not use East gate.|最终单西门18:05下车，南组走八分赶18:15调查，不走东门。'),reply('north-dm','Your promised North foot check stays17:00–17:20 on the public North path.|你已约北步行检查保留17:00–17:20，走北公共路。'),reply('south-dm','South meets the two-event rule. Bus drops you at West18:05; walk8 minutes, survey18:15–18:45.|南达两事件规则，车18:05西门下，走八分，18:15–18:45调查。'),operate('dispatch','send'),finish('Distinct events are corrected without losing photo credit. North foot and South bus orders are actually dispatched on the safe West route.|独立事件改准不丢摄影署名，北步行及南客车真单已按西门安全路线发出。')]
 near=swap(short,'source-b',operate('source-b','classify',event='new_event'),'OPERATE');wrong=swap(short,'old-fraud',write('old-fraud','Duplicate file means Bo fabricated the bird, so we removed his credit.|重复文件说明Bo造假，已撤署名。'),'WRITE')
