 g1=G(x,'Current authority and account|当前权力与账号','Use15:00 effective appointment and cedar-lio, not similar cedar-lio-work or old programme credit. Transfer print/wall actual ownership after real scoped acceptance; preserve the valid18:00 display.|按15点生效任命与cedar-lio，不混工坊账号或旧署名；真范围内接受后转印刷/墙所有权，保有效18点展示。',['appointment','identities','job-print-state','job-wall-state'],'19:00')
