 G(x,'Usable operator instructions and official record|可用操作指令与官方登记','Tell separate print/wall operators new actual contact/account and approved final files; update real school register with display_only scope and actual transfers, not merely final chat.|分别给印刷/墙操作人真新联系人账号及已批成品；真实学校册记display_only及实际转移，不只聊天。',['operator-print','operator-wall','handover-state'],'19:00')
