 x=newcase('t5-03','Blair','I produce small cycling shoots. I keep the measured claim separate from the clothing photographs and write exact kit handovers.|我制作小型骑行拍摄，把测量结论和服装照片分开，器材交接写具体。',[('Shoot caption|拍摄文案','A sunny photograph is not a speed test. Today we managed both, in different places.|阳光好看的照片不是测速，今天两样都有，在不同地方。'),('Private kit note|私下器材说明','The camera goes back with an empty card slot. Our card stays here for the edit.|相机空卡槽还，我们自己的卡留这剪。'),('Correction|更正','Those figures came from the closed track, not a public-road ride.|那些数字来自封闭跑道，不是开放公路骑行。')],'A cycling shoot loses the road, not the whole day|骑行拍摄用不了公路，整天却不必取消','It is16:00. Deliver both agreed outputs by19:00: a valid measured skinsuit comparison and the approved static clothing photographs. The moving public-road permit is withdrawn; the closed track or the accepted indoor-trainer protocol can still serve the measurement. Return the timing rig at17:25–17:30 and the camera at18:05–18:10 to their different next users. Keep private raw rider footage on our own card, not in the returned camera.|现在16:00，19点前交两份已约输出：有效紧身衣测量对比、获准静态服装照。开放公路动态许可撤了，封闭跑道或已接受室内台协议可测。计时架17:25–17:30交下一人，相机18:05–18:10交另一人，私人原始骑手画面留我们自有卡，不随相机还。','Open permit scope, exact shot list, measurement protocol, each rider’s terms, the two kit loans, transport timetable and the two separate client reviewers.|打开许可范围、确切镜头单、测量协议、两骑手约定、两份器材借用、运输时表和两位不同客户审稿人。',180)
 x.source('permits','Actual road/track/courtyard permits|实际公路跑道庭院许可',txt('permit','Public road moving-bike segment cancelled today. Closed track slot17:00–17:20 remains bookable for the measured protocol. Courtyard16:30–16:50 permits static clothing photos only. Indoor trainer room16:45–17:05 is an accepted measurement fallback. Moving bikes in courtyard are not permitted.|今日取消开放公路动态骑行，封闭跑道17:00–17:20仍可订测量，庭院16:30–16:50仅静态服装，室内台16:45–17:05是已接测量备选，庭院不可动态骑。'),field('location-state','Actual accepted location bookings|实际受理地点预约',{'measurement':None,'fashion':False}))
