 service_at(x,'clients','proofs','M and F go to different clients’ separate review spaces. Submit snapshots current actual output metadata; later source edits do not change a sent proof. Release publishes only the accepted snapshot.|M/F进不同客户独立审稿空间，提交冻结当前实际输出元数据，后改源不改已送证明；发布仅发已接受快照。',{'M':option('Deliver actual measured-data proof|交实际测量数据证明',copy=[{'from':'production-state','to':'proof-M','attributes':['fields']}],set={'client-state':{'M_sent':True}}),'F':option('Deliver actual static-clothing proof|交实际静态服装证明',copy=[{'from':'production-state','to':'proof-F','attributes':['fields']}],set={'client-state':{'F_sent':True}}),'release-M':option('Release accepted measured output|发布已接测量输出',variants=[{'when':{'fields':{'client-state':{'M_accepted':True}}},'copy':[{'from':'proof-M','to':'released-M','attributes':['fields']}],'set':{'client-state':{'M_released':True}},'facts':{'released':True}},{'when':{},'facts':{'released':False}}]),'release-F':option('Release accepted clothing output|发布已接服装输出',variants=[{'when':{'fields':{'client-state':{'F_accepted':True}}},'copy':[{'from':'proof-F','to':'released-F','attributes':['fields']}],'set':{'client-state':{'F_released':True}},'facts':{'released':True}},{'when':{},'facts':{'released':False}}])})
