 g1=G(x,'Real permitted measurement and honest claim|真实获准测量与诚实结论','Actually run supplied paired-repeat protocol at booked closed track or accepted indoor trainer, with matching transport/rig/time. Export claim must match actual method: never universal/public-road speed from either. Static photos cannot replace measurement.|真按已订封闭场或已接室内台配对重复协议测，运输架时间符合；导出说法配真实方法，均不冒充通用公路速度，静照不能替测量。',['permit','protocol','production-state','proof-M','released-M'],'19:00',alternative='Indoor trainer protocol is a full alternative with trainer resistance description and its earlier slot, not a failed road test.|室内台配阻力描述及更早时段是完整替代，不是失败公路测试。')
